**Layer rules:**
- `core/` → singletons; no component imports allowed here
- `shared/` → used in 2+ features; zero business-domain logic
- `features/` → self-contained slices; components inside are private to their feature
- `layout/` → structural shell; reads from services, never from feature components
- `models/` → pure TypeScript interfaces — NEVER import Angular here

