### FilmDetailComponent (Smart) — id via `input()`, no ActivatedRoute:
```typescript
@Component({
  selector: 'app-film-detail',
  standalone: true,
  changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush,
  imports: [RouterLink, DurationPipe],
  templateUrl: './film-detail.component.html',
