  @default         { <span class="badge">{{ film().genre }}</span> }
}

<!-- ❌ NEVER: -->
<li *ngFor="let film of films; trackBy: trackById">...</li>
<p *ngIf="!films.length">Nothing found</p>
```

**Template rules:**
- `track film.id` always — never `track $index` for entity lists
- `@for ... @empty` for list + empty state — cleaner than a separate `@if`
- `@if (signal(); as alias)` — reads signal once, reuses result
- No method calls that return new arrays/objects — use `computed()`
- Self-close components with no content: `<app-film-card ... />`
- Call signals with `()` in templates: `film()` not `film`

