**Rules:**
- NO global utility classes — component-scoped BEM only
- Angular `ViewEncapsulation.Emulated` (default) — do not disable it
- CSS variables in `:root` for all design tokens (colors, spacing, radius)
- `rem` for font sizes · `px` for borders/shadows · `%`/`fr`/`gap` for layout
- Responsive: use CSS Grid + Flexbox — no fixed-width containers

