## ══════════════════════════════════════════
## 20. WHAT CURSOR MUST NEVER GENERATE
## ══════════════════════════════════════════

- `NgModule`, `@NgModule`, `AppModule`, `BrowserModule`, `*.module.ts` files
- `*ngFor`, `*ngIf`, `*ngSwitch`, `[ngClass]`, `[ngStyle]`
- Any import from `'rxjs'` or `'rxjs/operators'`
- `Observable`, `Subject`, `BehaviorSubject`, `of`, `from`, `pipe()`, `subscribe()`, `takeUntil`, `combineLatest`, `switchMap` or any RxJS operator
- `toSignal` / `toObservable` from `@angular/core/rxjs-interop`
- `@Input()` / `@Output()` decorators — use `input()` / `output()` functions
- Constructor-based injection: `constructor(private x: X)` — use `inject()`
- `ChangeDetectionStrategy.Default` — always `OnPush`
- `standalone: false`
- `any` type annotation
- `document.querySelector` / `document.getElementById` outside of directives
- `ActivatedRoute` injection in components — use `input()` with `withComponentInputBinding()`
- `async` pipe (no observables exist in this project)
- `*.module.ts` files of any kind

